{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Guided 1.5K": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1.5公里引导跑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short, focused effort that builds toward a strong final 300 metres.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "短程专项训练，逐步加力，在最后300米有力收尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1.5 km · Fast and controlled": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1.5公里 · 快而可控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run · 1.5 km · controlled hard effort": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跑步 · 1.5公里 · 高强度但可控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find control before speed, hold your form through the middle, then build into the finish.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先稳住再提速，中段保持姿态，最后逐步加力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Guided 1.5K": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始1.5公里引导跑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run an evenly controlled 1500 metres and reserve the hardest sustainable effort for the closing segment.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以均匀、可控的强度跑完1500米，把最强且能维持的发力留给最后一段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm up with easy running, then add a few relaxed accelerations.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先轻松跑热身，再做几次放松的加速跑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an effort you can control for the full distance; this is not an all-out sprint.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择全程都能掌控的强度，这不是全力冲刺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick but contained": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速而克制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accelerate smoothly, settle your breathing, and avoid spending the first minute chasing pace.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平稳加速，稳住呼吸，第一分钟不要急着追配速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick and calm. Leave room to build.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快而从容，留出加力的余地。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the start already feels strained, ease back immediately and rebuild your rhythm.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果一开始就感到吃力，立即减速，重新找回节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hard, rhythmic, and repeatable": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强度高、节奏稳、可重复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a tall posture, relaxed shoulders, and an even rhythm through the longest section.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在最长的中段保持身体挺拔、肩膀放松、节奏均匀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay tall. Hold the rhythm.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "身体挺拔，守住节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shorten your stride slightly rather than forcing the pace.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "略微缩短步幅，不要硬追配速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hard with control": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高强度但可控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Begin a gradual build while keeping your arms compact and your stride underneath you.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始逐步加力，摆臂紧凑，落脚保持在身体下方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start the build. Smooth first, faster second.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始加力，先跑顺，再跑快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If form is fading, hold the current effort instead of accelerating.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果姿态开始走样，保持当前强度，不再加速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strongest sustainable finish": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以能维持的最强力度收尾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lift your cadence and commit to the line without tightening your face or shoulders.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提高步频，朝终点坚定前进，面部和肩膀保持放松。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two hundred to go. Fast feet, relaxed shoulders.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还剩200米，脚步轻快，肩膀放松。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the best form you can and carry the effort steadily to the finish.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尽量保持良好姿态，以稳定的强度跑到终点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep moving easily for several minutes after the distance ends.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成距离后继续轻松活动几分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Note whether the opening pace left enough control for the final 300 metres.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回顾起跑配速是否为最后300米留足了余力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop for sharp or increasing pain, dizziness, chest discomfort, confusion, or any symptom that feels unsafe.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如有尖锐或加重的疼痛、头晕、胸部不适、意识模糊或任何让你感到不安全的症状，请停止运动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Guided 3K": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3公里引导跑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three focused kilometres with a patient start and progressive finish.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "专注跑完3公里，从容起步，逐步加力收尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3 km · Controlled": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3公里 · 可控强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run · 3 km · steady-to-hard effort": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跑步 · 3公里 · 从稳定到高强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the first kilometre come to you, lock into the middle, and build only when control is secure.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一公里从容起步，中段锁定节奏，完全掌控后再加力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Guided 3K": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始3公里引导跑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete 3K with even mechanics and a controlled negative progression rather than an aggressive start.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以稳定的跑姿完成3公里，逐步提速，避免起步过猛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm up until easy running feels fluid.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热身到轻松跑感觉流畅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decide whether today is a steady benchmark or a harder time trial and keep the opening effort consistent with that choice.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先决定今天是稳定强度的基准跑，还是更高强度的计时跑，起步强度要与目标一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purposeful and contained": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "积极而克制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settle into efficient steps and let other runners or early pace changes go.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找到高效的脚步节奏，不跟跑他人，也不随早期配速波动而加速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settle first. The work comes later.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先稳下来，后面再发力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back off until breathing and form feel coordinated.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "减速到呼吸与跑姿重新协调。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Firm, even rhythm": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有力、均匀的节奏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your gaze forward, arms quiet, and pace even through the central kilometre and a half.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中间1.5公里保持目视前方、摆臂稳定、配速均匀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One rhythm. Relax into the work.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守住一个节奏，放松地投入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reduce pace slightly and protect form if the effort spikes early.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果过早感到吃力，稍微减速，优先保持姿态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hard and deliberate": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高强度、有意识地发力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Increase pressure gradually without reaching for a longer stride.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐步加力，不要刻意增大步幅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One kilometre left. Build with cadence.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还剩1公里，用步频带动提速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the current rhythm if a build would compromise form.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果加力会影响姿态，就保持当前节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong finish": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有力收尾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commit to the final 400 metres and keep your shoulders loose as cadence rises.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后400米坚定发力，提高步频时肩膀依然放松。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Four hundred to go. Commit and stay relaxed.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还剩400米，坚定向前，保持放松。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run strongly to the line at the best sustainable effort available today.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以今天能维持的最佳强度有力跑到终点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jog or walk easily until breathing settles.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻松慢跑或步行，直到呼吸平稳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Record whether the second half felt as controlled as the first.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录后半程是否和前半程一样可控。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Guided 5K": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5公里引导跑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A steady 5K with patient pacing and distance-based focus cues.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从容配速跑完5公里，按距离获得专注提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5 km · Steady": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5公里 · 稳定强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run · 5 km · steady effort": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跑步 · 5公里 · 稳定强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settle in early, stay smooth through the middle, and finish with control.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前段稳住，中段流畅，最后从容收尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Guided 5K": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始5公里引导跑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cover 5K at a sustainable effort, using the final kilometre to finish stronger only when the first four remain controlled.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以能维持的强度完成5公里；前4公里始终可控时，才在最后1公里加强发力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decide whether this is an easy completion run, a steady benchmark, or a race effort.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先决定这是轻松完赛跑、稳定强度的基准跑，还是比赛强度跑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Begin more conservatively than your first impulse.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "起步比直觉再保守一些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Patient and controlled": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从容、可控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the first kilometre to settle breathing, cadence, and posture.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用第一公里稳住呼吸、步频和姿态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Patient first kilometre. Find your rhythm.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一公里别着急，找到节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slow down or add a brief walk break before effort becomes strained.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在感到吃力之前减速，或短暂步行恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steady and repeatable": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稳定、可重复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the effort you chose, scan for relaxed shoulders, and avoid unnecessary surges.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持选定的强度，留意肩膀放松，避免不必要的加速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smooth through the middle. One steady gear.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中段跑顺，守住稳定节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a pace you could maintain for another kilometre beyond the finish.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择一种过了终点还能再跑1公里的配速。"
