        }
      }
    },
    "Focused and controlled": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "专注、可控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you still feel composed, gradually increase pressure; otherwise keep the same steady effort.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果仍然从容，逐步加力；否则保持原有的稳定强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One and a half to go. Build only if you own the pace.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还剩1.5公里，掌控配速后再加力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain rather than accelerate if breathing or form is deteriorating.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果呼吸或姿态开始失控，保持强度，不再加速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lift cadence, keep your face and hands relaxed, and run through the distance target.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提高步频，面部和双手放松，跑过目标距离。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Five hundred left. Strong form to the line.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还剩500米，保持有力姿态跑到终点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a proud, steady finish without sprinting.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稳稳地跑完，无需冲刺。"
