        }
      }
    },
    "Cover 10K with even effort, avoiding early surges and preserving enough control to run the final two kilometres well.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以均匀强度跑完10公里，避免前段突然加速，为最后2公里留足掌控力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick an effort that matches today's purpose and conditions.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据今天的目标和环境选择合适的强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use familiar hydration if conditions or duration call for it; do not experiment during a goal effort.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据天气和时长按熟悉的方式补水；目标跑中不要尝试新的补给方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Patient and aerobic": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从容、有氧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start below the effort you expect to hold later and let your body warm into the distance.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "起步强度低于后段计划，让身体逐渐适应距离。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two patient kilometres. Save the work for later.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前2公里耐心些，把发力留给后面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ease off or add an early walk break if breathing rises too quickly.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果呼吸上升太快，减速或提前短暂步行。"
