        }
      }
    },
    "Even, economical rhythm": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "均匀、省力的节奏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold an economical pace, check posture periodically, and take the route one kilometre at a time.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持省力的配速，定期检查姿态，一公里一公里地跑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cruise the middle. Quiet arms, steady feet.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中段顺畅巡航，摆臂稳，脚步匀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reduce effort until you can speak a short sentence without gasping.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "降低强度，直到能不喘气地说完一句短句。"
