          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始半程马拉松引导跑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help a prepared runner complete 21.0975K with restrained early effort, even middle kilometres, and a finish based on actual readiness.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帮助已有准备的跑者完成21.0975公里：前段克制、中段均匀，最后根据真实状态决定如何收尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm the route, conditions, water access, and practiced fueling plan before starting.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始前确认路线、环境、饮水点及练习过的补给计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set an effort ceiling for the first 10K and commit not to chase early pace.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为前10公里设定强度上限，不追逐早期配速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deliberately restrained": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刻意保留余力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the field or watch go if needed; establish relaxed breathing and an economical stride.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必要时不跟随人群或手表配速，建立放松的呼吸和省力的步幅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three patient kilometres. Protect the day.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前3公里耐心些，为全程留余地。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slow down early; small corrections now are cheaper than large corrections later.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尽早减速；现在的小调整，胜过后面的被迫大调整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comfortably sustainable": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "舒适、可持续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock into a repeatable rhythm and follow your practiced hydration and fueling timing.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锁定能重复的节奏，按练习过的时间补水、补给。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settle and fuel as practiced. Nothing new today.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稳住节奏，照常补给，今天不尝试新方法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walk briefly at an aid point or reduce pace if fueling, heat, or hills raise the effort.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果补给、炎热或坡度让强度升高，在补给点短暂步行或减速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steady concentration": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稳定、专注"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run kilometre to kilometre, keep fueling familiar, and make posture the priority when fatigue appears.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一公里一公里地跑，沿用熟悉的补给方式，疲劳时优先照顾姿态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Past halfway. Keep the rhythm honest and simple.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已过半程，守住简单、稳定的节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shift to a planned run-walk pattern before fatigue becomes a crisis.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在疲劳变得难以应付前，切换到预定的跑走交替模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Focused late-race work": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后程专注发力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold effort on hills and into wind; build only if breathing, form, and fueling all remain stable.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上坡、逆风时维持强度；只有呼吸、姿态和补给都稳定时才加力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Five kilometres left. Focus first, build second.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还剩5公里，先专注，再加力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain or add short walk breaks; finishing safely is the priority.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持强度或加入短暂步行；安全完成最重要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Best safe finish available": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以安全范围内的最佳状态收尾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run the final 1.1K with compact form and increase effort only as the finish becomes certain.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后1.1公里保持紧凑姿态，确定能顺利完成后再增加强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Final 1.1K. Strong, compact, and all the way through.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后1.1公里，有力、紧凑，一直向前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep moving safely at the best sustainable effort available.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以能维持的最佳强度安全前进。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep walking after the finish and begin your practiced recovery routine.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "冲线后继续步行，开始练习过的恢复流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not make immediate training decisions; review pacing and fueling after recovery.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不要立刻决定后续训练，恢复后再回顾配速和补给。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop and use event or emergency support for chest discomfort, faintness, confusion, severe shortness of breath, loss of coordination, or any symptom that feels unsafe.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如有胸部不适、濒临晕厥感、意识模糊、严重气短、协调能力下降或任何让你感到不安全的症状，请停止运动并寻求赛事支援或紧急救助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop for sharp or worsening pain rather than trying to finish through it.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出现尖锐或加重的疼痛时请停止，不要忍痛坚持完赛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Guided Marathon": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全程马拉松引导跑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A prepared runner's 42.2K guide for even pacing, familiar fuel, and safe decisions.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "面向已有准备的跑者，以均匀配速、熟悉补给和安全决策完成42.2公里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "42.2 km · Endurance": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "42.2公里 · 耐力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run · 42.2 km · prepared marathon effort": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跑步 · 42.2公里 · 需具备马拉松基础"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start slower than excitement suggests, follow the plan you practiced, and make patient decisions deep into the distance.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "起步比兴奋时想跑的更慢，执行练习过的计划，后程始终耐心判断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Guided Marathon": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始全程马拉松引导跑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help a prepared runner complete 42.195K through even pacing, practiced fueling, and conservative choices when conditions or symptoms change.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帮助已有准备的跑者完成42.195公里，保持均匀配速、熟悉的补给方式，并在环境或症状变化时采取保守选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm route support, weather, emergency contacts, location sharing, aid access, and your practiced fuel and hydration plan.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认路线保障、天气、紧急联系人、位置共享、补给点，以及练习过的补给和补水计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commit to a conservative first 10K and to adjusting effort for heat, hills, wind, or unexpected symptoms.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前10公里保持保守，遇到炎热、坡道、风或意外症状时及时调整强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Almost too easy": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻松到几乎觉得太慢"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let excitement pass through without turning it into pace; establish calm breathing and clear space around you.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让兴奋自然过去，不把它变成速度；稳住呼吸，留出周围空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Five protected kilometres. Easy is the assignment.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前5公里保护体力，轻松就是任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slow down immediately if the start does not feel restrained.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果起步感觉不够克制，立即减速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Economical and routine": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "省力、熟悉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settle into repeatable mechanics and begin the exact fueling and hydration routine practiced in training.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稳定重复跑姿，开始严格执行训练中练习过的补给和补水流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make it routine. Easy rhythm, familiar fuel.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按熟悉的方式来：轻松节奏，熟悉补给。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use aid-station walk breaks or reduce pace before small issues compound.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在小问题累积之前，利用补给站步行休息或减速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steady patience": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稳定、耐心"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the course in small sections, keep fueling familiar, and resist any urge to race before 30K.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把赛道分成小段，沿用熟悉的补给方式，30公里之前抵住提速比赛的冲动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Patient through thirty. Keep stacking calm kilometres.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "耐心跑过30公里，一公里一公里从容积累。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust for heat, hills, stomach issues, or rising effort; the original pace is no longer the goal if conditions have changed.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据炎热、坡度、肠胃问题或强度上升调整；环境变了，就不要固守原配速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deep, controlled work": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "深入发力、保持可控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Focus on posture, compact steps, and the next landmark; hold effort rather than forcing pace.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "专注姿态、紧凑脚步和下一个路标，保持强度，不硬追配速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the work. Short horizon, steady form.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在进入关键段，目标放近，姿态稳住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adopt a deliberate run-walk pattern and use course support before the situation becomes unsafe.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在情况变得不安全前，主动采用跑走交替并寻求赛道支援。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Best safe effort available": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全范围内的最佳强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep decisions simple: form, direction, aid, next kilometre. Increase effort only when your condition is stable and the finish is close.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把决策简化为姿态、方向、补给和下一公里。状态稳定且接近终点时才增加强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Five kilometres left. Stay safe, stay compact, keep moving forward.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还剩5公里，注意安全，脚步紧凑，继续向前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walk, stop at aid, or end the attempt if symptoms or conditions make continuing unsafe.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果症状或环境让继续前进变得不安全，请步行、到补给点停下或结束尝试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep walking through the finish area and accept support if you feel unwell or unsteady.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过终点区时继续步行；如感到不适或站立不稳，请接受帮助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Begin the recovery routine you prepared, and delay analysis until you are warm, fed, hydrated, and settled.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始准备好的恢复流程，等到保暖、进食、补水且状态平稳后再分析表现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop when weather, route conditions, loss of supplies, or loss of support makes continuing unsafe.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果天气、路线、补给或支援条件使继续前进变得不安全，请停止运动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
