          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毫不费力地活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walk and notice whether your body loosens, stays the same, or feels worse.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "步行时留意身体是逐渐放松、没有变化，还是感觉更差。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check in. Recovery is the whole job.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "感受身体，恢复就是全部目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End the session if movement increases pain or fatigue.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果活动使疼痛或疲劳加重，请结束训练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Very easy jog or walk": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非常轻松的慢跑或步行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jog only if it feels smoother than walking; switch freely between both.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有慢跑比步行更顺畅时才跑，两者可以随时切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gentle enough to feel restorative.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻柔到能帮助恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walk or stop; there is nothing to complete at the expense of recovery.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以步行或停止；没有任何目标值得牺牲恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walk easily and finish as soon as you feel settled.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻松步行，感觉平稳后就结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bring it down and keep the recovery win.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "慢下来，守住恢复的收获。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop early in a safe place.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提前在安全地点结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You should feel the same or better than when you began.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结束时应与开始时一样，或感觉更好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel worse, prioritize rest and reconsider the next hard session.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果感觉更差，请优先休息，并重新考虑下一次高强度训练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop if movement increases pain, changes your gait, or produces dizziness, chest discomfort, confusion, or any symptom that feels unsafe.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果活动使疼痛加重、步态改变，或出现头晕、胸部不适、意识模糊及任何让你感到不安全的症状，请停止运动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
