        }
      }
    },
    "Easy running or walking": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻松跑或步行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete four consistent two-minute fast repeats with enough control that the final repeat matches the first.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成4组均匀的2分钟快速跑，强度始终可控，让最后一组与第一组一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a flat, interruption-free route or track.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择平坦、无中断的路线或跑道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast means controlled hard running, not sprinting.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速跑是可控的高强度跑，不是冲刺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy and gradually warmer": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻松、逐渐热身"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run easily and let cadence rise naturally near the end without forcing pace.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻松跑，接近热身结束时让步频自然提升，不强迫提速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm first. Speed comes after eight minutes.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先热身，8分钟后再提速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extend the easy running or convert the workout to Easy 30 if you do not feel ready.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果还没准备好，延长轻松跑，或改做30分钟轻松跑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast, repeatable efforts with easy recoveries": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可重复的快速跑与轻松恢复交替"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run each work block at the fastest pace you can repeat evenly; jog or walk every recovery until breathing settles.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个快速段都采用能均匀重复的最快配速；每次恢复都慢跑或步行，直到呼吸平稳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast and repeatable. Recovery is part of the workout.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快而可重复，恢复也是训练的一部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slow the next repeat, shorten it, or skip it if form or control does not return.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果姿态或掌控力未恢复，下一组减速、缩短或跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reduce effort immediately and keep moving gently until breathing settles.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即降低强度，温和活动到呼吸平稳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fast work is done. Bring everything down.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速段结束了，全面放松下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walk the full cooldown.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整个放松段都可以步行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fourth fast repeat should look and feel similar to the first.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第4组快速跑的姿态和感受应与第1组相近。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow with easy training or recovery rather than another hard session.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之后安排轻松训练或恢复，不紧接另一场高强度训练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End the fast work if your form breaks down or you cannot regain control during recovery.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果姿态失控，或恢复段也无法重新掌控，请结束快速跑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tempo 35": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
