            "value": "维持15分钟适度吃力的跑步，不逐渐变成比赛强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose effort by feel rather than a pace that ignores terrain or weather.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据体感选择强度，不用忽视地形和天气的固定配速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tempo should finish controlled, not depleted.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "节奏跑结束时应仍然可控，而非筋疲力尽。"
