          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻松、能交谈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm gradually and wait for the timed transition before increasing effort.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐步热身，等计时切换后再增加强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ten easy minutes. Save the tempo.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先轻松跑10分钟，把发力留给节奏段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay easy for the whole run if you do not feel ready after ten minutes.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10分钟后仍没准备好，就全程保持轻松。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comfortably hard and even": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
