        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适度吃力、均匀"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lift to an effort where short phrases are possible, then hold without surging.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提升到还能说短句的强度，随后保持稳定，不突然加速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Firm and even. Fifteen minutes, not a time trial.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有力、均匀地跑15分钟，不是计时赛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reduce to steady running if breathing becomes ragged or pace keeps fading.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果呼吸紊乱或配速不断下降，降低到稳定强度跑。"
