          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose effort by feel and terrain rather than chasing identical pace on every surge.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据体感和地形选择强度，不追求每段加速都达到相同配速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The three-minute surge should be strong but sustainable, not the fastest.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3分钟加速段应有力且能维持，无需跑得最快。"
