          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按体感跑；上坡配速不能与平地配速直接比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run easily and confirm that the hill and footing are safe.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻松跑，并确认坡道和落脚处安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm up and inspect the hill.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热身并检查坡道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose flat easy running if conditions are unsafe.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果环境不安全，就选择平地轻松跑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong uphill, complete recovery": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有力上坡、充分恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use compact steps, a slight lean from the ankles, and active arms; walk or jog the recovery safely.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "脚步紧凑，从脚踝处略微前倾，积极摆臂；安全地步行或慢跑恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tall hips, compact feet, full recovery.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "髋部挺起，脚步紧凑，充分恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End a repeat early, walk down, or stop the set if footing or form becomes unreliable.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果落脚或姿态不稳，可提前结束该组、步行下坡或停止整组训练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move easily away from the hill and let effort fall gradually.": {
      "comment": "Original curated workout editorial copy. Preserve all numbers and safety meaning.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻松离开坡道，让强度逐渐下降。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hill work done. Easy from here.": {
